    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86918" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόγραμμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>public proclamation</i> or <i>notice, edict, PRev. Laws</i><i><span class="en">
				9.7
			</span></i><span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Galb.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				4.9.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				65.1
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>placard, notice,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Herm.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				2108.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMasp.</u>
				353.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>order of the day, agenda</i> of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουλή</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκλησία,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				25.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				44.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>title</i> of a prescription, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.909
			</span></i>; <i>address</i> of a letter, <i><span class="en">
				Procop.Gaz.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>injunction, advice,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(2).141
			</span></i>.</div>
